  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Central Bank of the Solomon Islands ICT Modernization Roadmap, through IOS Partners, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds technical assistance (TA) for the Central Bank of the Solomon Islands (CBSI) to develop a roadmap for the modernization of its ICT infrastructure. The proposed TA would identify upgrades to CBSI&apos;s existing ICT infrastructure and develop specifications and an implementation plan for deploying new banking applications that would improve the central bank&apos;s operations.</narrative>
  </description>
